7
00:00:11,866 --> 00:00:12,860
and solved both.

8
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:13,561
Days later,

9
00:00:13,561 --> 00:00:15,791
Dantzig left the proofs on Neyman's

10
00:00:15,791 --> 00:00:18,277
