23
00:00:43,455 --> 00:00:45,832
block ninety quiet morning minutes with

24
00:00:45,832 --> 00:00:46,686
pen and paper,

25
00:00:46,686 --> 00:00:49,002
and work the problem assuming a clean,

26
00:00:49,002 --> 00:00:50,830
